Package: kulan-assistant
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: @PUBLISHER@ <@MAINTAINER_EMAIL@>
Section: gnome
Priority: optional
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0 (>= 4.12), gir1.2-adw-1 (>= 1.5), systemd, pipewire-bin
Recommends: kulan-assistant-engine, kulan-settings (= @VERSION@), poppler-utils, python3-nautilus, gir1.2-tsparql-3.0, tracker-miner-fs
Homepage: @HOME_URL@
Description: @NAME@ Assistant: private writing help, summaries and search
 Dictation (speak and your words are typed where the cursor is), writing
 tools for the text you select in any app (proofread, rewrite,
 friendlier, professional, shorter, summary, key points, translate),
 "Summarise" for documents in Files, Translate and Explain after Live Text,
 and file search with questions in Activities.
 .
 Everything runs on this computer with an open model (Qwen3, Apache-2.0)
 that is downloaded once from Kulan Settings > Assistant. Nothing you
 select, summarise or search for is sent anywhere.
